      48.0,
      365.97,
      420.06,
      404.63
    ],
    "reading_order": 14,
    "text": "In Class IX, we considered some examples of the use of modelling. Did they give you\nan insight into the process and the steps involved in it? Let us quickly revisit the main\nsteps in mathematical modelling.",
    "latex": null,
    "image_ref": null,
    "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
