      420.03,
      448.07
    ],
    "reading_order": 15,
    "text": "Step 1 (Understanding the problem) : Define the real problem, and if working in a\nteam, discuss the issues that you wish to understand. Simplify by making assumptions\nand ignoring certain factors so that the problem is manageable.",
    "latex": null,
    "image_ref": null,
    "confidence": 1.0
  },
  {
    "document_id": "NCERT_X_MATH_JEMH1A2",
