    "bbox": [
      48.0,
      453.09,
      420.06,
      491.75
    ],
    "reading_order": 16,
    "text": "For example, suppose our problem is to estimate the number of fishes in a lake. It is\nnot possible to capture each of these fishes and count them. We could possibly capture\na sample and from it try and estimate the total number of fishes in the lake.",
    "latex": null,
    "image_ref": null,
    "confidence": 1.0
